{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56097","headline":"真人赞六首 二 · 杜光庭","name":"真人赞六首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亹亹玄中趣，湛湛清汉波。\n代谢若旋环，椿木不改柯。\n静心念至真，随运顺离罗。\n感应理常通，神适逮自徂。\n澹游初无际，繁想洞九遐。\n飞根散玄叶，理返非由他。\n常能诵玉章，玄音彻霄霞。\n甲申洪灾至，椌翮王母家。\n永享无终纪，岂知年劫多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}